{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21013","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21013-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21013-0","text":"智识命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21013-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21013-1","text":"她在台上挥着手，希望每个人跟着她一起发出自己的声音。\n不管是歌唱、呐喊、哀叹，以任何形式。\n发出自己的声音，直到有人听见，才会有人加入。\n\n「别让心冷了，变得和这个城市一样冷。」\n\n——别让世界静下来。","speaker":""}]}
